  ('f2459270-0c71-5838-b07b-65e4ad79785a', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g10-character-setting-plot'), null, 'hard',
   $q$At the end, Adaeze signs her initials beside Tomas's note. What does this action suggest about her and about the story's theme?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She shifts from urging the estimate to backing his honesty, supporting the theme that trustworthy data matters more than winning.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She still disagrees but obeys the rules, which suggests the theme that rules matter more than friendship.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misreads-character-change"},{"text":"She is claiming credit for the note, which suggests the theme that leaders take the glory.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"She is quietly correcting his mistake, which suggests the theme that estimates are more accurate than counts.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She shifts from urging the estimate to backing his honesty, supporting the theme that trustworthy data matters more than winning.$q$, $q$Signing beside "Clouded over, no observations" shows she now stands behind the honest record she had first argued against. Nothing suggests she is correcting him or claiming credit; she adds her name to his note rather than changing it.$q$, 'draft', '5181c286-dfeb-56ae-b916-e39709050393')
